        "crc32() 失败 nBadCrc++；半帧保留返回 0；旧入口 DecodeNovOem7Dat()",
        "decode_bestpos()→BLHToXYZ()；decode_rangeb_oem7()；decode_gpsephem()/decode_bdsephem()"
      ]
    },
